# Synthesised CloudFormation and the CLI's staged assets. Regenerated by
# `cdk synth` on demand and machine-specific (asset hashes include local
# paths), so committing it would produce a diff on every developer's machine.
cdk.out/
# Context the CLI caches from live AWS lookups (AZs, AMIs, …). The stack is
# deliberately environment-agnostic and does none, so this should stay empty —
# if it appears, something has started depending on a real account.
cdk.context.json
